name: wordforge
title: Wordforge - Office Word Processor
version: '0.6.13-preview'
summary: Office word processor, document editor and writer - DOCX, PDF, rich text
description: |
  Wordforge is a fast, native office word processor, document editor and rich text
  writer for Linux. It runs fully offline and private: no account, no cloud, no browser
  engine inside.

  Write with real page layout, paragraph styles (Normal, Title, Headings),
  bullets and numbering, indents and justified text, tables with borders and
  shading, pictures, bookmarks, find and replace, and spell check as you type. Copy and paste keeps formatting from web pages,
  Microsoft Word and LibreOffice. Print, export PDF, and open or save DOCX files
  (complex Word features are not preserved yet). Text shaping covers Hindi and
  other Indic scripts, Arabic, Hebrew, Chinese, Japanese, Korean and emoji.
  Plain text files in any common encoding (UTF-16, Shift_JIS, GB18030, Big5,
  EUC-KR, Windows code pages) open correctly. Unsaved work is recovered after a crash. Light and dark themes, a Ctrl+K
  command palette and a distraction-free focus mode keep the page in front.

  Opens and saves DOCX, the document format used by Microsoft Word (MS Word),
  LibreOffice Writer, WPS Office, ONLYOFFICE and Google Docs downloads, so you can
  exchange files with people who use them. A lightweight, offline office writer
  for letters, reports, notes and assignments.

  Review documents with comments and tracked changes (accept or reject), add
  footnotes and endnotes, links, a table of contents, headers and footers with page
  numbers, and tables with merged cells.
  This is a developer preview: some advanced Word features (sections, columns)
  are not supported yet. Built with C++20, Qt 6 and Skia; open source under
  Apache-2.0. Also available for Windows.
base: core24
grade: stable
confinement: strict
license: Apache-2.0
links:
  website:
    - https://akmcypher.github.io/wordforge/
  source-code:
    - https://github.com/akmcypher/wordforge
  issues:
    - https://github.com/akmcypher/wordforge/issues
  contact:
    - https://github.com/akmcypher/wordforge/issues
architectures: [@ARCH@]
apps:
  wordforge:
    command: bin/wordforge-launch
    plugs: [desktop, desktop-legacy, x11, wayland, home, removable-media, opengl, cups]
